# Production build config for the client.
#
# Two deployment modes are supported:
#
# 1. SAME-ORIGIN (default, recommended):
#    Leave VITE_API_URL unset. The app calls the relative "/api" path and
#    netlify.toml proxies it to the Render backend, so the httpOnly auth
#    cookie stays same-origin. No CORS configuration required.
#
# 2. CROSS-ORIGIN:
#    Uncomment the line below to point the app directly at Render. This requires
#    CLIENT_URL on the backend to list your Netlify domain and secure cookies
#    (COOKIE_SECURE=true) to be enabled.
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-server.onrender.com/api
